        title: "IPTV HDMI Encoder Professional Signal Digitization and Network Streaming",
        excerpt: "Looking to understand how an iptv hdmi encoder works? Read our 1400 word technical overview covering signal ingestion, H.265 HEVC compression, network protocols, and Eagle4k.",
